Page Type: SCP Article

Elevator Pitch: It’s an artist that can give life to its creations

Central Narrative: An artist that can create anything, that varies from sculpting and painting, to sewing and many more, it can than chose to give life to them or not.

Hook/Attention-Grabber: The Artist shows to possess a few anomalous items. The creations of the Artist will harbor anomalous effects, some may cause a sensation of happiness, while others cause the opposite. The Behavior of the creations also depend on the feelings of the Artist during the creation process.

