What kind of person is this artist?

-He is a very cheerful and friendly, yet shown to be dangerous and even malicious

Does he know how to use his anomalous abilities?

-Yes, he does. In an incident report, that I have in mind, I imagine that he used his creation to escape containment

-The abilities that I have in mind for him include

1-Giving life to his creations and controlling them

2-He also has a bag that seems to be some kind of ''pocket dimension'', where he pulls out different art supplies

3-He also produces a black ink like substance that is what allows his anomalous properties in the first place, he might be able to sort of teleport using his powers

4-He can also access or enter drawings or pull stuff out of them

The reason that he can do so much stuff is that he has lived for a long time and learned how to sculpt and draw overtime

Is this good? What could be changed or bettered?





